A home in the City of the Prophet ﷺ — where each day begins within reach of the Haram.

To live in Al-Aliyah is to live inside Madinah's story: its date palms, its blessed soil, the call to prayer drifting over the rooftops at dusk. This is that rare address — a place you don't just buy, you belong to.

FOR SALE | Family compound of two villas on 1,600 m² — Al-Aliyah, Madinah

15 min to the Prophet's Mosque · 7 min to Quba Mosque · 3 min to Aliat Mall
Shuran/L district · Plan 634/T/1413 · Plot 43

Held under two independent electronic title deeds (currently co-ownership between father and son). Each villa offers 5 en-suite bedrooms, multiple majlis, 8 bathrooms and a rooftop annex — Villa One fully renovated, with a home elevator and an elderly-friendly ramp. The shared grounds carry ~20 producing date palms, a licensed artesian well, a volleyball court and shaded parking for six cars.

The entire property, under both deeds: SAR 8,000,000 — negotiable for serious buyers. Ready for viewing.

